# Reviewed Trivy exceptions for the CI image scans (.github/workflows/ci.yml).
# One CVE per line, each with the date, the image it applies to, why it does
# not affect this deployment, and when to revisit. Anything not listed here
# that is HIGH/CRITICAL with a fix available fails the build — the answer is
# normally to rebuild (apt/apk upgrade at build time) or bump a base image,
# not to add a line here. Keep this file short; docs/supply-chain.md explains
# the review process.
#
# Format:  CVE-YYYY-NNNNN   # <date> <image>: <reason>; revisit <when>
